-09-11T22:25:27Z"},"body":"does what the title says.\r\n\r\nThe actual button referred to as \"one-click deploy\" is actually \"remote deploy\", that's what the tooltip for it actually says, there are also several part of the documentation that call it remote deploy, though the majority in the class reference and manual uses \"one click deploy\". This discrepancy was noticed earlier in PR #87295, but that PR had the reverse fix. The general consensus at the time was remote deploy is the better name. I've brought this up in rocket chat and that still seems to be the consensus.\r\n\r\nOther names have been suggested that may be more fitting but so far there has been no consensus other than \"one-click deploy is a bad name.\" So for that reason I'm sticking to remote deploy. I will open a corresponding PR in the documentation repository later.\r\n\r\nSupersedes #87295","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122858/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},